{"title":"My podcast with Nebular","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/949613231/0/marginalrevolution~My-podcast-with-Nebular.html","date":1772774779000,"content":"<blockquote><p>We’ve just published the video on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fyoutu.be%2FaJsBMitjj7A&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C0b34de46cc5742a3776408de7a192a99%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639082445708147074%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=7%2FiGE5Xu9zeOacMqXIUPuGRGjR%2B0xP1pD%2BBQ6l7Q67U%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FFinnMurphy12%2Fstatus%2F2029257444850020411&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C0b34de46cc5742a3776408de7a192a99%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639082445708198318%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=VX3JpIPS0nru0xqnCUCN5H1Es7c60h9jGqPc6H3k5dk%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fopen.spotify.com%2Fepisode%2F6tY8c63KnEN3MgU7UX2d9G%3Fsi%3DFmoSUUciTsGaljhQnneXVQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C0b34de46cc5742a3776408de7a192a99%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639082445708247125%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=kbmK3sB%2BhsMMm0PwfchF2pW4t4ikCqwEq4B2YtI%2F%2BQU%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>, and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpodcasts.apple.com%2Fus%2Fpodcast%2Fforecast-2050%2Fid1882029736%3Fi%3D1000752896571&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C0b34de46cc5742a3776408de7a192a99%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639082445708296174%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=2F5XTleOaf6xbOWmVLTgLutj2rDSMDgOk%2BIEE9ZR%2Bpw%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Apple Podcasts</a>. We also published some <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffinnmurphyirl.substack.com%2Fp%2Fhumans-love-stasis-and-hate-change&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C0b34de46cc5742a3776408de7a192a99%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639082445708339840%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=6LmqIsrqciFc0lVddPXt18cUjDJyeidYGPwyyn3b6wY%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">extended show notes</a> and the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fhome%2Fpost%2Fp-189726563&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C0b34de46cc5742a3776408de7a192a99%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639082445708379285%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=z6qj57QaDITCgKYl6Fu9pK16SLWH63hxrhmEGZ8Qrt4%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">transcript</a> on Substack.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>I thought they did an excellent job here, and lots of fresh material.  We start with the fertility crisis:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p><strong>Murphy</strong>: We’ve always had a majority young society, and in our lifetime, we’ll have this transition to majority old society. When you make this transition and it impacts so many different areas of life, do you still believe that technology can solve our way out of it?</p>\r\n<p><strong>Cowen</strong>: Solved is never quite the word. But the older people in this room and I guess that’s only me. We have the luxury of having seen what old people were like in the 1960s and 70s, and mostly they were a wreck. So, so many people would be shot by 60. And now there are many 80-year-olds who are more dynamic than a typical 60-year-old might have been, say, in 1972.</p>\r\n<p>So that will somewhat help keep us more equally dynamic. So there are countervailing trends which are quite positive. There might be You could call them mind altering substances that would help older people be young again, like Viagra for the mind. I’m not predicting that. I’m just saying there’s a lot of variables here, and I think we’ll have recourse to many interventions that will help keep things going at an acceptable level.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>And this:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p><strong>Murphy</strong>: Do you believe that there is life on the moons of Saturn?</p>\r\n<p><strong>Cowen</strong>: I would bet 60/40 yes. But it wouldn’t be life like us. You know, it might be little shrimpy things or even just something like bacteria. Maybe [the moons of]Jupiter also.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Interesting throughout.  Here are <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.google.com/search?q=gp+nebular&amp;sca_esv=0c0ded2c55dfde36&amp;sxsrf=ANbL-n7nxLTlemHZvsrF9hlaw-0Dt3-Few%3A1772649687934&amp;source=hp&amp;ei=13yoaerpNsme5NoPq-mh6Q4&amp;iflsig=AFdpzrgAAAAAaaiK56Ih8-2mni-uWGJTAWkSi2nFm4Ci&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiqsdXX8oaTAxVJD1kFHat0KO0Q4dUDCCE&amp;uact=5&amp;oq=gp+nebular&amp;gs_lp=Egdnd3Mtd2l6IgpncCBuZWJ1bGFyMggQABgWGAoYHjILEAAYgAQYhgMYigUyBRAAGO8FMgUQABjvBTIIEAAYgAQYogQyBRAAGO8FMgUQABjvBUjMEFAAWLgKcAB4AJABAJgBgQGgAc8GqgEDOC4yuAEDyAEA-AEBmAIKoAKCB8ICCxAAGIAEGLEDGIMBwgIREC4YgAQYsQMY0QMYgwEYxwHCAgsQLhiABBjRAxjHAcICCBAAGIAEGLEDwgIFEAAYgATCAggQLhiABBixA8ICDRAAGIAEGLEDGIMBGArCAg4QLhiABBixAxjRAxjHAcICCxAAGIAEGJIDGIoFwgIHEAAYgAQYCsICCBAAGIAEGMkDwgILEC4YgAQYxwEYrwHCAgYQABgWGB6YAwCSBwM4LjKgB7g-sgcDOC4yuAeCB8IHBzAuNy4yLjHIBySACAA&amp;sclient=gws-wiz\" target=\"_blank\">links on Nebular and Finn Murphy</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/my-podcast-with-nebular.html\">My podcast with Nebular</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/949613231/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/949613231/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/949613231/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/949613231/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/949613231/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/949613231/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/my-podcast-with-nebular.html#respond\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/my-podcast-with-nebular.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> </div>","author":"Tyler Cowen","siteTitle":"Marginal Revolution","siteHash":"242a3a39129b36e0c574c3796ca7ef3cf8af967286c2998fabf7240d1ad52a47","entryHash":"a84c51f